      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدخّن</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَخَّرَ</span> [<i>He fumigated himself</i>]:
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بخر</span>:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدُّخْنَةُ</span>. (Mgh.) You
say, of a man, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تدخّن بِالدُّخْنَةِ</span> [<i>He fumigated
himself with what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُخْنَة</span> q. v.]; as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِدَّخَنَ</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِفْتَعَلَ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also 1.

